  introTitle: Welcome to Sweet Factory!
  introBody: "Your mission is to press SPACE as quickly as possible to collect only
    the card with THREE DONUTS. \r\n\r\nAll other cards are sugar traps - leave them
    alone and keep your focus on the red cross.\r\n\r\nWhen you\u2019re ready, press
    SPACE to begin a training round."
