  trainingIntroTitle: Welcome to Sweet Factory!
  trainingIntroBody: "Your mission is to press SPACE as quickly as possible to collect
    only the card with THREE DONUTS. \r\n\r\nAll other cards are sugar traps - leave
    them alone and keep your focus on the red plus sign.\r\n\r\nWhen you\u2019re
    ready, press SPACE to begin a training round."
  readyIntroTitle: Focus
  readyIntroBody: "\rRandom visual and audio distractions will appear -  ignore them
    and keep your focus on the red plus sign.\r\n\r\nAt the end of the round, you\u2019ll
    collect a gem. More correct cards mean a stronger gem and a faster way home.\r\n\r\nPress
    SPACE to begin the real mission. Good luck!"
